BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ca' del Bosco Wine Garden
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260522
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260523
DTSTAMP:20260829T151757Z
UID:ec504bb30a685e605b7475ceee57@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Ca' del Bosco Wine Garden Location: The Chanler at Cliff Walk 
 May 22 - September 7\, 2026 1:00 PM - 8:00 PM This season\, settle into a 
 cozy Adirondack chair beneath the dappled shade of umbrellas and enjoy a g
 lass of Franciacorta or a refreshing Spritzer at the Ca'del Bosco Wine Gar
 den. From your seat\, take in the tranquil views of Easton's Bay\, coastal
  beauty without the hassle of the beach or the crowds. Whether you've been
  exploring Newport's iconic Cliff Walk or simply seeking a peaceful escape
 \, the Ca'del Bosco Wine Garden offers the perfect retreat. Relax\, savor 
 exceptional wine\, and let the gentle sea breeze remind you of Newport's t
 imeless charm. Please Note: No reservations are required\, and complimenta
 ry parking is available. Adirondack chairs are offered on a first-come\, f
 irst-served basis with a 90-minute seating limit. A $30 per person food an
 d beverage minimum applies. For additional details\, please refer to our f
 ull list of frequently asked questions here. Open weather permitting and c
 losed for private events on select dates. View the full calendar here.\n\n
 Source: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/ca-del-bosco-wine-garden/10
 9874/
LOCATION:The Chanler at Cliff Walk May 22 - September 7\, 2026 1:00 PM - 8
 :00 PM This season\, settle into a cozy Adirondack chair beneath the dappl
 ed shade of umbrellas and enjoy a glass of Franciacorta or a refreshing Sp
 ritzer at the Ca'del Bosco Wine Garden. From your seat\, take in the tranq
 uil views of Easton's Bay\, coastal beauty without the hassle of the beach
  or the crowds. Whether you've been exploring Newport's iconic Cliff Walk 
 or simply seeking a peaceful escape\, the Ca'del Bosco Wine Garden offers 
 the perfect retreat. Relax\, savor exceptional wine\, and let the gentle s
 ea breeze remind you of Newport's timeless charm. Please Note: No reservat
 ions are required\, and complimentary parking is available. Adirondack cha
 irs are offered on a first-come\, first-served basis with a 90-minute seat
 ing limit. A $30 per person food and beverage minimum applies. For additio
 nal details\, please refer to our full list of frequently asked questions 
 here. Open weather permitting and closed for private events on select date
 s. View the full calendar here. Show More View Website | Email 1 / 1 Addit
 ional Information\, 117 Memorial Boulevard\, Newport\, RI 02840
