BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Back in Black live at Ballard’s
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260829
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260830
DTSTAMP:20260829T151757Z
UID:39ade7b58262bd80f5907cf4e2e8@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Back in Black live at Ballard’s brings the true ACDC concert
  experience to Block Island with the kind of raw loud energy that fits per
 fectly with an oceanfront crowd. Touring for decades and known for accurac
 y and intensity this band delivers a high voltage set that feels like a re
 al arena show dropped right onto the beach Expect the biggest ACDC anthems
  and the riffs everyone knows the moment they hit. The performance is fast
  tight and built for full volume singalongs with a stage presence that kee
 ps the patio moving from the first chord to the last chorus. If you want c
 lassic rock that hits hard and keeps the momentum up all night Back in Bla
 ck live at Ballard’s is the show to plan around\n\nSource: https://www.v
 isitrhodeisland.com/event/back-in-black-live-at-ballard%e2%80%99s/110506/
LOCATION:Ballard's Beach Resort\, 42 Water Street\, Block Island\, RI 0280
